          </div>
          <div class="content__d">
            <p class="setSmallFS">Effective for purchases made on <a href="https://beyondbeyond-shop.myshopify.com/">www.beyondbeyond.co.in</a></p>
            <h5>Products Not Eligible for Return</h5>
            <p>The following categories of products shall be deemed ineligible for return under any circumstance:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Products that are found to be damaged or degraded due to use, excessive use or mishandling;</li>
              <li>Products returned with missing items or components, or with original packaging that is damaged, including but not limited to price tags, seals, labels, tampered packaging, complimentary gifts and/or accompanying accessories; and</li>
              <li>Products bearing altered, defaced or removed serial numbers or batch codes.</li>
            </ul>
            <h5>Cancellation Process</h5>
            <p>You may cancel your order within a window of one (1) hour from the time of placement, provided that the items in your order have not been dispatched. Cancellations must be made by logging into your account on the Website.</p>
            <p>Should you fail to cancel the order within the aforementioned one-hour period, the cancellation shall no longer be permissible. For pre-paid orders that are cancelled within the stipulated time, a full refund shall be processed. The refund shall be initiated within twenty-four (24) to forty-eight (48) business hours from the time of successful cancellation, subject to internal verification and processing.</p>
            <p>FYREMIST PRIVATE LIMITED reserves the right, at its sole discretion, to reject a cancellation or defer the associated refund by a period of up to three (3) to six (6) months for users found to have a previous record of questionable or excessive cancellations, including multiple bulk order cancellations.</p>
            <h5>Return Process</h5>
            <p>You may raise a request for return within forty-eight (48) hours from the date of delivery of your order. Any return shall be subject to a quality check conducted upon collection of the returned item(s). Approval of your return shall be contingent on the results of this assessment.</p>
            <p>Refunds for accepted returns shall be initiated once the product(s) are collected from your location. The refund, in cases of payment via debit/credit card or net banking, will be processed back to the original payment method within twenty-four (24) to forty-eight (48) business hours from the date of pickup. The credited amount may take an additional three (3) to seven (7) working days to reflect in your bank account. For orders paid via cash on delivery, the refund shall be remitted to your designated bank account after collection of relevant account details.</p>
            <h5>Refunds, Replacements, and Returns</h5>
            <p>You may initiate a return for part of or the entirety of your order, strictly in the following circumstances:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Products have been damaged or compromised during transit;</li>
              <li>Packaging of the product is visibly damaged upon arrival;</li>
              <li>An incorrect item has been delivered to you.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Beyond Beyond shall not be obligated to accept return requests for any product that does not fall within the above-listed scenarios.</p>
            <p>Requests for replacement shall be processed only subject to the availability of stock. Where a replacement cannot be arranged due to non-availability, a refund shall be initiated instead. Replacement requests are only valid for the same item that was originally ordered and delivered in a damaged or incorrect condition. Exchange for another product or variant is not permitted under any circumstances.</p>
            <p>FYREMIST PRIVATE LIMITED reserves the right to refuse transactions or delay refunds by a period of three (3) to six (6) months if the requesting customer has previously initiated multiple questionable or bulk cancellations.</p>
            <h5>Process for Submitting a Return, Replacement or Refund Request</h5>
            <p>To initiate a return, replacement or refund request, please proceed via the designated section of the Website and select the appropriate reason for your request. You shall also be required to upload the following four (4) images of the product received:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Clear image of the front of the product showing the product name;</li>
              <li>Clear image of the back of the product including ingredient list and batch details;</li>
              <li>Image of the product’s barcode or batch number;</li>
              <li>Image of the outer packaging box, including visible signs of damage (if applicable).</li>
