            <h5 class="removeTBorder" style="border-top:unset;">Delivery Procedure</h5>
            <p>Once your order has been successfully processed through our system, each product undergoes a final inspection to ensure it meets our quality standards and is in optimal condition for delivery. Thereafter, the products are securely packed and handed over to our authorised logistics partners for shipment.</p>
            <p>The consignment shall be delivered to you at the earliest possible time by our delivery partners. In the event of any difficulty in locating your address or any unforeseen delay, the delivery personnel may attempt to contact you for clarification or resolution.</p>
            <h5>International Shipping</h5>
            <p>At present, Beyond Beyond ships orders exclusively within the territory of India. International deliveries are currently not available.</p>
            <h5>Tracking Information</h5>
            <p>Upon dispatch of your order, you shall receive an email confirming shipment, which will include the name of the courier service, along with the tracking number. You may track the progress of your shipment after a period of 24 hours from dispatch, either through the courier service’s website or via the tracking link provided by us.</p>
            <p>You acknowledge that the visibility of your tracking information may be subject to a delay of up to 24 hours, or more, due to technical or operational circumstances beyond the reasonable control of FYREMIST PRIVATE LIMITED.</p>
            <p>You may also monitor the status of your order by logging into your account on our Website, or by accessing the designated order tracking page.</p>
            <h5>Delivery Timelines</h5>
            <p>Most orders are typically dispatched within 1 to 2 business days, excluding Sundays and recognised public holidays, and are delivered within the estimated timeline displayed on the relevant product page at the time of placing the order.</p>
            <p>You understand and agree that delivery timelines may vary depending on the origin of dispatch, warehouse availability, and the delivery destination's postal code. The confirmed estimated date of delivery shall be communicated once your order has been shipped.</p>
            <p>It is further understood that deliveries may be delayed due to reasons beyond our reasonable control, including but not limited to, force majeure events such as acts of God, natural disasters, political unrest, lockdowns, strikes, logistics disruptions, or any governmental or legal orders. You agree that such delays shall not entitle you to any claim for refund, cancellation, or compensation for the delayed delivery of products within the timeline initially communicated.</p>
            <h5>Secure Delivery Protocol</h5>
            <p>To ensure secure receipt of all orders, we employ verification protocols using Delivery Acceptance Codes, which shall be sent to you via SMS and/or email at the time of delivery. In the event that you do not receive the Delivery Acceptance Code, you agree to provide a valid identity document to the delivery personnel to complete the handover of the package.</p>
